[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24541.27, "timestamp": "06:49:01", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24543.91, "timestamp": "06:49:03", "text": "待って、何曜日？ああ、そう。夜にやる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24548.39, "timestamp": "06:49:08", "text": "デイリークエストをやらなきゃいけないのを忘れてた。ああ。ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24557.83, "timestamp": "06:49:17", "text": "ああ、またテスト。オーケー。オーケー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24559.59, "timestamp": "06:49:19", "text": "。こいつらは盲目だ。オーケー。行け、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24574.39, "timestamp": "06:49:34", "text": "オーケー。彼を投げる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24585.43, "timestamp": "06:49:45", "text": "そして彼は死んだ。E"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24589.59, "timestamp": "06:49:49", "text": "F。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24591.11, "timestamp": "06:49:51", "text": "さよなら。"}]